<title>UK: Westpac sets 250 mln stg five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Westpac sets 250 mln stg five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager HSBC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTPAC BANKING CORP</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   SPREAD     FLAT	MATURITY    11.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.959    FULL FEES   0.125</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.959</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS 100(K) -1(M)  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA (2)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.075</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
